<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent buy reiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said it reiterated its buy on Lucent Technologies Inc and raised its 18-month price target to $55 after the stock hit its $45 target.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 45-7/8 Monday.  AT&amp;T Corp on Monday began distributing to shareholders the 525 million Lucent shares it holds, finalizing its spinoff of Lucent.</p>
</text>
